1
00:00:00,041 --> 00:00:01,499
(This drama complied with production
guidelines for filming child actors,)

2
00:00:01,501 --> 00:00:03,042
(and some scenes used
generative AI technology.)

3
00:00:03,291 --> 00:00:05,291
(Episode 46)

4
00:00:05,816 --> 00:00:07,357
He fired Do Hee?

5
00:00:07,458 --> 00:00:10,708
Yeah. I guess he was upset
she skipped work without a word.

6
00:00:11,750 --> 00:00:13,208
Well, he used to be in the military.

7
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:18,166
He said he'd look out for his own.
If he was just going to fire her...

8
00:00:20,458 --> 00:00:21,958
That leaves a bitter taste, right?

9
00:00:23,916 --> 00:00:26,250
So is the publishing company
completely shut down now?

10
00:00:26,333 --> 00:00:27,472
Well, it's forced leave.

11
00:00:27,916 --> 00:00:30,250
The CEO said
we should take a break and start again.

12
00:00:31,541 --> 00:00:34,041
Why don't the three of us,
including Jung A, go somewhere?

13
00:00:35,416 --> 00:00:37,583
You're on vacation. We're not.

14
00:00:37,625 --> 00:00:39,424
Let's just close the cafe for a few days.

15
00:00:39,875 --> 00:00:40,992
How about going to the beach?

16
00:00:41,909 --> 00:00:44,583
That punk Ji Hu went to the beach
all by himself.

17
00:00:45,166 --> 00:00:46,541
- "The beach?"
- Yeah.

18
00:00:46,886 --> 00:00:49,178
He went alone to clear his head.

19
00:00:49,713 --> 00:00:51,505
Now I'm even more worked up.

20
00:00:52,317 --> 00:00:55,609
But I heard Do Hee attacked you again?

21
00:00:56,166 --> 00:00:58,708
I told Ji Hu to stay away from you.

22
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:01,413
- What?
- The reason Do Hee treats you that way...

23
00:01:01,458 --> 00:01:02,916
is all because of Ji Hu.

24
00:01:04,541 --> 00:01:05,541
Yes.

25
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:08,375
Well, I won't be seeing him
anymore anyway.

26
00:01:08,666 --> 00:01:10,833
That's right. You're my Ji Ni.

27
00:01:11,875 --> 00:01:13,041
Don't hang out with him.

28
00:01:13,208 --> 00:01:15,775
What? "My Ji Ni?"

29
00:01:16,916 --> 00:01:18,333
What are you talking about?

30
00:01:20,625 --> 00:01:21,708
Drink up.

31
00:01:26,875 --> 00:01:29,163
Don't stay cooped up at home.
Go out and get some air.

32
00:01:29,541 --> 00:01:30,541
Here.

33
00:01:31,458 --> 00:01:33,153
What if Seung Hyun comes by?

34
00:01:34,248 --> 00:01:36,081
If he gets upset because I'm out again...

35
00:01:36,083 --> 00:01:37,391
Stop worrying about what he thinks.

36
00:01:37,500 --> 00:01:39,791
Staying like this will make you lonely.

37
00:01:40,567 --> 00:01:42,026
You should live your own life.

38
00:01:42,458 --> 00:01:46,037
This is just my style.
The hopelessly devoted type.

39
00:01:46,750 --> 00:01:50,625
You saw it yourself.
I dated him for a little while,

40
00:01:51,750 --> 00:01:54,750
and they all came after me
because they hated seeing me that way.

41
00:01:55,373 --> 00:01:58,331
If you're afraid of getting criticized,
you can't do anything.

42
00:01:58,500 --> 00:02:00,875
Look at me.
I'm a pro at getting criticized.

43
00:02:01,284 --> 00:02:04,049
The people criticizing me may get tired,
but I never do.

44
00:02:04,875 --> 00:02:06,416
Aren't you just something?

45
00:02:07,625 --> 00:02:10,375
I'll head out first. Eat up.

46
00:02:28,178 --> 00:02:33,554
Sa Bin, I'm sorry about yesterday.
And thank you.

47
00:02:51,985 --> 00:02:56,125
Fine. Just leave.
Go ahead and leave me all alone.

48
00:02:56,500 --> 00:02:59,625
If I were meant to get married,
would I be living like this?

49
00:03:08,208 --> 00:03:10,125
This is so frustrating.

50
00:03:10,708 --> 00:03:12,500
Come on, not again.

51
00:03:22,625 --> 00:03:24,958
Doctor, are you feeling sick again today?

52
00:03:25,711 --> 00:03:27,419
- Yeah.
- Should we close for the day?

53
00:03:27,958 --> 00:03:31,166
No, I should at least work until noon.

54
00:03:38,291 --> 00:03:40,291
(Sa Bin, I'm sorry about yesterday.
And thank you.)

55
00:03:43,267 --> 00:03:46,309
It's okay, Yeong Ju.
I completely understand.

56
00:03:48,469 --> 00:03:52,386
Are you feeling okay?
I'm worried you might get sick.

57
00:05:10,969 --> 00:05:16,386
Yeong Ju.

58
00:05:22,541 --> 00:05:23,875
It's okay.

59
00:05:32,458 --> 00:05:34,208
Yeong Ju.

60
00:05:42,921 --> 00:05:45,796
Please open the door.

61
00:05:47,383 --> 00:05:49,281
I'm trapped in here.

62
00:05:49,949 --> 00:05:51,824
Please open the door.

63
00:06:09,541 --> 00:06:10,875
(It's okay, Yeong Ju.
I completely understand.)

64
00:06:23,458 --> 00:06:25,666
Yeong Ju, answer your phone.

65
00:06:26,125 --> 00:06:29,458
What are you doing? Come on, answer it.

66
00:06:30,719 --> 00:06:33,083
Yeong Ju, answer your phone.

67
00:06:33,208 --> 00:06:36,708
What are you doing? Come on, answer it.

68
00:06:37,125 --> 00:06:39,875
- Sa Bin.
- Yeong Ju, answer your phone.

69
00:06:40,250 --> 00:06:43,708
What are you doing? Come on, answer it.

70
00:06:45,333 --> 00:06:47,541
Yeong Ju, answer your phone.

71
00:06:47,750 --> 00:06:50,875
What are you doing? Come on, answer it.

72
00:06:50,916 --> 00:06:52,125
Sa Bin.

73
00:06:52,666 --> 00:06:54,750
- Yeong Ju, answer your phone.
- Sa Bin.

74
00:06:55,208 --> 00:06:58,458
What are you doing? Come on, answer it.

75
00:07:01,708 --> 00:07:04,666
The person you're calling is unavailable.
Please leave a message...

76
00:07:11,000 --> 00:07:14,166
Yeong Ju, you're okay, right?
Nothing happened, right?

77
00:07:19,052 --> 00:07:22,927
I just hope nothing happened...

78
00:07:47,949 --> 00:07:51,449
Who is it? Who's there?

79
00:07:52,916 --> 00:07:55,833
Please open the door.

80
00:07:57,416 --> 00:07:59,375
I'm trapped in here.

81
00:07:59,958 --> 00:08:01,833
Please open the door.

82
00:08:06,109 --> 00:08:07,109
Ma'am?

83
00:08:09,083 --> 00:08:11,625
Ji Ni.

84
00:08:14,083 --> 00:08:15,083
Yes.

85
00:08:19,208 --> 00:08:20,250
Just a moment.

86
00:08:39,333 --> 00:08:42,458
Ma'am, what do we do...

87
00:08:50,402 --> 00:08:54,615
Ma'am, how long
have you been trapped in here?

88
00:09:13,666 --> 00:09:17,416
All day long, seriously!

89
00:09:18,574 --> 00:09:20,672
It's a relief you came early.

90
00:09:21,458 --> 00:09:23,541
That needs to be fixed tomorrow.

91
00:09:28,666 --> 00:09:30,875
I got through it
by splashing cold water on myself.

92
00:09:33,143 --> 00:09:37,310
I'm so sick of this damn house.
I can't stand it anymore.

93
00:09:38,875 --> 00:09:40,291
Ma'am...

94
00:09:42,094 --> 00:09:44,719
Ma'am, you should get remarried.

95
00:09:45,616 --> 00:09:46,991
Not you, too.

96
00:09:48,080 --> 00:09:52,330
I just want to live alone.
I'm just unlucky with men.

97
00:09:54,645 --> 00:09:55,684
I'm sorry.

98
00:09:56,583 --> 00:09:57,833
Not that again.

99
00:09:58,500 --> 00:10:00,916
I keep telling you, it's not your fault.

100
00:10:01,125 --> 00:10:04,166
It's not your fault either.
What did you do wrong?

101
00:10:04,892 --> 00:10:08,142
And why do you assume you're unlucky?

102
00:10:10,533 --> 00:10:15,199
Honestly, compared with dad,
the Korean medicine doctor is much better.

103
00:10:18,958 --> 00:10:21,416
Yeah, you're right about that.

104
00:10:22,416 --> 00:10:24,178
He's much better, that's for sure.

105
00:10:25,837 --> 00:10:30,587
Sa Bin was the only one
who called me earlier.

106
00:10:31,083 --> 00:10:32,500
I couldn't answer, though.

107
00:10:33,291 --> 00:10:34,605
See him again.

108
00:10:35,254 --> 00:10:37,662
I hope you meet
someone much better than dad...

109
00:10:38,250 --> 00:10:41,333
and live a happier life than mom did.

110
00:10:42,875 --> 00:10:47,142
Seung Hyun left because he was struggling,
and I'm supposed to remarry?

111
00:10:47,635 --> 00:10:48,916
He'll come back.

112
00:10:49,681 --> 00:10:51,750
And he'll live his own life.

113
00:10:52,416 --> 00:10:55,208
You should live your own life too.

114
00:10:55,833 --> 00:10:57,099
You're a woman.

115
00:10:57,708 --> 00:11:00,208
A woman who wanted to love and be loved.

116
00:11:01,903 --> 00:11:05,166
Take revenge on love for betraying you.

117
00:11:05,458 --> 00:11:06,791
With a love that makes you very happy.

118
00:11:06,875 --> 00:11:08,708
"Take revenge on love?"

119
00:11:11,853 --> 00:11:13,811
There was a time when I wanted to.

120
00:11:15,033 --> 00:11:17,744
I wanted to throw the papers at your mom
just to spite her.

121
00:11:19,583 --> 00:11:20,875
But Seung Woo...

122
00:11:23,500 --> 00:11:25,458
Who would I leave Seung Woo with?

123
00:11:26,625 --> 00:11:30,250
I've lived a stifling life here
for one reason or another.

124
00:11:31,208 --> 00:11:36,333
Ma'am, I'm okay now, and so is he.

125
00:11:37,750 --> 00:11:39,875
I feel the most sorry for you.

126
00:11:40,416 --> 00:11:42,375
I really wanted to support you,

127
00:11:42,416 --> 00:11:46,250
so when Ji Hu suggested we help
with the proposal, I gladly agreed.

128
00:11:48,750 --> 00:11:53,208
I was really happy that I could help you.

129
00:11:55,208 --> 00:11:58,916
Don't you hate me?
I treated you so harshly.

130
00:12:00,083 --> 00:12:01,311
I was scared of you.

131
00:12:02,208 --> 00:12:04,916
When I was bullied at school
and people pointed fingers at me,

132
00:12:05,875 --> 00:12:09,708
I blamed you a lot too.

133
00:12:10,468 --> 00:12:13,384
But when I thought about it,
I realized I was wrong.

134
00:12:13,916 --> 00:12:16,125
I shouldn't have blamed you.

135
00:12:17,678 --> 00:12:21,428
So from then on,
I started being harsh with mom.

136
00:12:25,458 --> 00:12:28,458
If I had been your daughter
instead of mom's,

137
00:12:29,000 --> 00:12:30,583
I would've done even worse.

138
00:12:33,152 --> 00:12:36,110
To think we're talking like this...

139
00:12:36,833 --> 00:12:38,500
Time really changes things.

140
00:12:42,166 --> 00:12:45,125
Wait a minute. Who is it?

141
00:13:06,777 --> 00:13:07,880
Ma'am.

142
00:13:20,344 --> 00:13:21,386
Yeong Ju.

143
00:13:23,475 --> 00:13:26,684
Why weren't you answering?
You had me worried.

144
00:13:31,705 --> 00:13:32,914
Sa Bin.

145
00:13:39,833 --> 00:13:45,041
Sa Bin.

146
00:13:55,469 --> 00:13:56,803
Thank you.

147
00:14:05,497 --> 00:14:10,679
Sa Bin.

148
00:14:12,370 --> 00:14:16,162
Sa Bin.

149
00:14:16,489 --> 00:14:20,864
Sa Bin.

150
00:14:46,208 --> 00:14:47,208
How is he feeling?

151
00:14:48,291 --> 00:14:49,583
The fever's gone down.

152
00:14:51,353 --> 00:14:54,603
Let's go to the hospital.
Can you help support him?

153
00:14:54,666 --> 00:14:55,833
Yeah.

154
00:14:56,333 --> 00:14:58,333
No, I'm fine.

155
00:14:59,208 --> 00:15:00,375
I don't need to go.

156
00:15:03,750 --> 00:15:05,500
Are you feeling a little better?

157
00:15:07,083 --> 00:15:08,916
Water, please.

158
00:15:08,958 --> 00:15:10,291
You want water?

159
00:15:36,916 --> 00:15:38,375
Why are you so reckless?

160
00:15:38,958 --> 00:15:40,625
Why did you come here like this?

161
00:15:40,875 --> 00:15:44,125
I told you I'd come
if I couldn't reach you.

162
00:15:45,219 --> 00:15:48,428
I was afraid
something had happened to you.

163
00:15:50,037 --> 00:15:51,412
I was so worried.

164
00:15:52,333 --> 00:15:57,125
After I texted you,
I thought it was over between us.

165
00:15:59,165 --> 00:16:04,498
I didn't want to look at my phone,
so I got locked in the bathroom.

166
00:16:04,500 --> 00:16:05,583
Seriously.

167
00:16:07,375 --> 00:16:08,625
All day?

168
00:16:10,916 --> 00:16:15,065
Being trapped in there made me
think about a lot of things.

169
00:16:16,458 --> 00:16:20,833
This house where I lived for 30 years,
abandoned and without a spark of life...

170
00:16:22,916 --> 00:16:25,833
I'm sick of it. I want to leave.

171
00:16:28,041 --> 00:16:31,166
I felt so trapped all day.

172
00:16:33,041 --> 00:16:34,708
Just like my life.

173
00:16:37,041 --> 00:16:41,333
Is this all my life amounts to?

174
00:16:43,333 --> 00:16:48,291
Is this how my dreams,
my life, are going to end?

175
00:16:50,875 --> 00:16:52,791
But then the phone rang.

176
00:16:54,125 --> 00:16:55,958
It was telling me, "Answer the phone."

177
00:16:58,041 --> 00:17:00,208
I wanted so badly
to get out and answer it.

178
00:17:01,875 --> 00:17:04,458
After no one came looking for me all day,

179
00:17:05,875 --> 00:17:07,666
you came looking for me, Sa Bin.

180
00:17:10,000 --> 00:17:11,666
The phone just kept ringing.

181
00:17:12,868 --> 00:17:15,701
Four times, five times...

182
00:17:16,208 --> 00:17:17,405
Nine times.

183
00:17:24,125 --> 00:17:27,166
That's right. Thank you so much.

184
00:17:33,289 --> 00:17:34,872
Se Ri told me something.

185
00:17:36,047 --> 00:17:40,631
Having the man you love love you back...

186
00:17:41,666 --> 00:17:43,612
is what every woman wants.

187
00:17:45,436 --> 00:17:47,603
That's why she couldn't give up.

188
00:17:48,958 --> 00:17:50,721
I was jealous and angry.

189
00:17:53,750 --> 00:17:54,791
I want...

190
00:17:57,583 --> 00:17:59,875
to be a happy woman too.

191
00:18:07,375 --> 00:18:08,916
I'll make you happy.

192
00:18:11,750 --> 00:18:13,375
I love you with all my heart.

193
00:18:17,583 --> 00:18:19,666
What you just said...

194
00:18:21,523 --> 00:18:26,916
Can I take that as you
accepting my proposal?

195
00:18:33,250 --> 00:18:34,420
Yes!

196
00:19:06,375 --> 00:19:07,791
Excuse me, sir.

197
00:19:10,081 --> 00:19:13,040
I told you not to get out
and to stay in the taxi.

198
00:19:13,041 --> 00:19:14,041
Go inside.

199
00:19:16,734 --> 00:19:19,109
Don't worry about me.
Go inside and get some rest.

200
00:19:19,208 --> 00:19:21,458
If it gets bad, go to the ER.

201
00:19:22,458 --> 00:19:26,000
I'm fine now. I was just lovesick.

202
00:19:26,916 --> 00:19:28,458
And you're my cure, Yeong Ju.

203
00:19:32,291 --> 00:19:34,666
Thanks for bringing me home.
You should go now.

204
00:19:36,708 --> 00:19:38,000
Sorry you're going back alone.

205
00:19:38,083 --> 00:19:40,125
Don't worry about it. Go inside.

206
00:19:41,375 --> 00:19:42,583
Go on.

207
00:20:17,699 --> 00:20:18,783
Hello.

208
00:20:19,708 --> 00:20:20,916
It's been a while.

209
00:20:21,666 --> 00:20:22,958
Business going well?

210
00:20:23,963 --> 00:20:26,255
I'll have udon and a bottle of soju.

211
00:20:26,375 --> 00:20:27,458
Okay.

212
00:20:32,458 --> 00:20:33,601
Enjoy your meal.

213
00:21:50,125 --> 00:21:53,666
Seriously, Yeong Ju mixed them up again.

214
00:21:59,375 --> 00:22:02,833
Let's see. Here it is.

215
00:22:13,083 --> 00:22:14,291
What's this?

216
00:22:20,083 --> 00:22:21,083
No way.

217
00:22:32,041 --> 00:22:33,250
You're back?

218
00:22:33,791 --> 00:22:34,791
Yeah.

219
00:22:42,916 --> 00:22:44,250
- What are you doing?
- What?

220
00:22:45,250 --> 00:22:47,750
You mixed up our bras again.

221
00:22:48,000 --> 00:22:49,458
- Did I?
- Yeah.

222
00:22:52,094 --> 00:22:53,344
Have you been drinking?

223
00:22:54,000 --> 00:22:55,416
Just a little.

224
00:22:56,373 --> 00:22:58,060
- Get some rest.
- Okay.

225
00:23:15,026 --> 00:23:17,234
How does she have so many gold bars?

226
00:23:17,333 --> 00:23:18,833
Even the ones I bought her.

227
00:23:19,291 --> 00:23:23,407
Those gold bars
must've come from grandpa...

228
00:23:24,291 --> 00:23:28,083
He didn't give Ji Ni any.
What a spiteful old man.

229
00:23:30,046 --> 00:23:31,560
Maybe I shouldn't have left them there.

230
00:23:32,833 --> 00:23:33,958
Should I go back for them?

231
00:23:51,708 --> 00:23:53,000
No.

232
00:23:53,791 --> 00:23:58,625
Still, I have to get back
what belongs to Ji Ni.

233
00:24:21,250 --> 00:24:23,458
Why did Ji Hu suddenly go to the beach?

234
00:24:25,291 --> 00:24:27,000
Maybe he's thinking about his childhood.

235
00:24:36,291 --> 00:24:38,916
Joong Bin, Sun Kyung.

236
00:24:40,000 --> 00:24:42,708
Why do you both look so down?

237
00:24:43,625 --> 00:24:45,875
It's because of you, Sa Bin.

238
00:24:50,416 --> 00:24:53,208
I'm sorry for all the trouble
I've caused you, Sun Kyung.

239
00:24:57,583 --> 00:25:00,208
Joong Bin, I'm getting married.

240
00:25:01,000 --> 00:25:03,291
Don't talk nonsense, you fool.

241
00:25:03,533 --> 00:25:06,369
You were burning up last night.
Now you're talking about marriage?

242
00:25:06,378 --> 00:25:07,403
Are you dreaming?

243
00:25:07,916 --> 00:25:10,416
That's right. I was sick yesterday.

244
00:25:10,750 --> 00:25:13,458
But I feel completely fine now.
Sun Kyung, I'm not sick anymore.

245
00:25:14,384 --> 00:25:15,843
And I'm getting married.

246
00:25:16,500 --> 00:25:18,875
Yeong Ju agreed to marry me.

247
00:25:22,692 --> 00:25:25,817
You two have nothing to worry about.

248
00:25:25,875 --> 00:25:29,000
I'll take care of everything,
the house and all the furnishings.

249
00:25:29,250 --> 00:25:32,666
I'll handle everything.
You just need to come celebrate with us.

250
00:25:33,291 --> 00:25:34,291
Well,

251
00:25:35,456 --> 00:25:37,706
I should head to the clinic early today.

252
00:25:37,833 --> 00:25:39,647
I haven't seen patients in days.

253
00:25:58,208 --> 00:25:59,346
Sa Bin.

254
00:26:00,208 --> 00:26:02,375
What is it, Joong Bin? I'm busy.

255
00:26:03,254 --> 00:26:04,796
Are you really getting married?

256
00:26:05,083 --> 00:26:06,916
I told you I am.

257
00:26:07,015 --> 00:26:09,875
Don't try to stop me.
It won't work. I've made up my mind.

258
00:26:09,916 --> 00:26:12,583
Aren't you going to have children?

259
00:26:12,625 --> 00:26:13,833
No, I'm not.

260
00:26:14,250 --> 00:26:17,250
Yeong Ju and I will grow old
happily together.

261
00:26:17,291 --> 00:26:19,333
Our family needs children.

262
00:26:19,958 --> 00:26:21,708
Please think it over.

263
00:26:21,833 --> 00:26:24,541
Ji Hu is enough for the family.

264
00:26:24,750 --> 00:26:26,291
I won't have children. No, I can't.

265
00:26:26,949 --> 00:26:29,116
How can I think of having children now?

266
00:26:31,333 --> 00:26:33,458
I'll adopt later if Yeong Ju wants to.

267
00:26:34,541 --> 00:26:36,583
Wait, Sa Bin.

268
00:26:37,000 --> 00:26:38,583
Joong Bin, I'm busy.

269
00:26:44,458 --> 00:26:45,875
No luck, right?

270
00:26:48,333 --> 00:26:52,208
That Yeong Ju has some nerve.

271
00:26:52,500 --> 00:26:54,958
She said she wouldn't marry him,
then changed her mind days later?

272
00:26:55,833 --> 00:26:57,088
I knew she'd do this.

273
00:26:57,208 --> 00:27:00,583
Why would she let
a pushover like Sa Bin slip away?

274
00:27:01,350 --> 00:27:04,434
A pushover? Why is Sa Bin a pushover?

275
00:27:05,291 --> 00:27:06,880
Does being kind make him a pushover?

276
00:27:06,916 --> 00:27:09,500
Why are you getting annoyed?
Did I say something wrong?

277
00:27:09,666 --> 00:27:13,316
All he can do is make herbal medicine.
What else can he do?

278
00:27:13,583 --> 00:27:15,931
He's far too kind and gentle...

279
00:27:16,250 --> 00:27:18,916
A sly woman could easily control him.

280
00:27:19,833 --> 00:27:21,471
Still, watch what you say.

281
00:27:51,708 --> 00:27:54,999
(Family Register)

282
00:27:55,000 --> 00:27:57,291
What do you mean?
Why would my mom sponsor anything?

283
00:27:57,416 --> 00:27:59,083
- We should go see our future home.
- Our home?

284
00:27:59,125 --> 00:28:01,500
Could you come today?
Please come visit me.

285
00:28:01,541 --> 00:28:02,875
I'll treat you to a nice meal.

286
00:28:02,916 --> 00:28:05,083
- You need to save this company.
- As CEO?

287
00:28:05,166 --> 00:28:08,625
Your dream is to marry into this family
and have me boss you around, right?

288
00:28:08,666 --> 00:28:10,458
Why are you being like this?

289
00:28:10,500 --> 00:28:12,250
What do you want me to do?

290
00:28:12,291 --> 00:28:16,208
I just want one chance
to live a normal life before I die.

291
00:28:17,933 --> 00:28:19,933
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)
